{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["I''s","Aiming to become a molding artist, Itsuki, a childhood friend of Ichitaka who went to America come back to Japan. Iori who refused the idol path and started to pursue her ambition to become an actress instead. Ichitaka, wandering on his bicycle alone, tries to decide his choice between the two persons.\n\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"],"ja":["フロム I\"s アイズ 〜もうひとつの夏の物語〜",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1084","ids":{"shikimori":1084,"mal":1084,"anilist":1084,"kodik":"serial-57837"},"kodikIds":["serial-27254","serial-57837"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27254":"2020-06-29T15:25:54Z","serial-57837":"2024-03-10T19:49:02Z"},"title":"Айдзу","originalTitle":"From I''s: Mou Hitotsu no Natsu no Monogatari","alt":"フロム I\"s アイズ 〜もうひとつの夏の物語〜 I''s フロム I\"s アイズ 〜もうひとつの夏の物語〜","description":"Ицуки Акиба, мечтающая стать модельером, вернулась в Японию из Америки — она подруга детства Ититаки. Иори Ёсидзуки же отказалась от карьеры айдола и решила пойти по пути актрисы, следуя своей мечте. А Ититака Сэто, одиноко колеся на велосипеде, пытается сделать выбор между этими двумя девушками.","year":2002,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Драма","Романтика"],"rating":5.92,"popularity":2592,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://st.kp.yandex.net/images/film_big/856733.jpg","width":549,"height":782},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/7a49aee46f819a4c558b6ea165e251a50a73e0cd.jpg","width":720,"height":544}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1048","dubId":"1048","label":"Евгения Лурье","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-27254","translationId":"1048","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/677741/c2b1a1237e50ac2aeb0ba3c4893f4266/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kod